# ControlRoom

ControlRoom is a context-aware instruction framework for AI-assisted work, coding, personal projects, writing, research, and future domains.

## Model

Every task starts with `core/` and then combines one or more contexts.

Examples:

- `core + code + work` — software development for work
- `core + code + personal` — personal software projects
- `core + writing + work` — professional documentation or communication
- `core + research + personal` — research for a personal decision

## Structure

```text
ControlRoom/
├── core/
├── contexts/
│   ├── code/
│   ├── work/
│   ├── personal/
│   ├── writing/
│   └── research/
├── templates/
├── prompts/
└── scripts/
```

All generated content is English by default, even when the user communicates in Swedish, unless another language is explicitly requested.
